{"id":"H8174","lemma":"שַׁ֫עַף","transliteration":"shaaph","sayIt":"SHA-aph","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Shaaph","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.2.47;\nson of Caleb (H3612H) and Jahdai (H3056);\nbrother of: Regem (H7276), Jotham (H3147I), Geshan (H1529), Pelet (H6404) and Ephah (H5891I)\n§ Shaaph = \"division\"\n1) son of Jahdai of the family of Caleb, the brother of Jerahmeel\n2) son of Caleb, the brother of Jerahmeel, by his concubine Maachah and father of Madmannah","glosses":["shaaph"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":47,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Shaaph","kjv":"and Shaaph"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":49,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Shaaph","kjv":"also Shaaph"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:47","note":"The sons of Jahdai: Regem, Jothan, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah, and Shaaph.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H3056","lemma":"יַהְדַּי","transliteration":"yehday","gloss":"Jahdai"},{"id":"H3612","lemma":"כָּלֵב","transliteration":"kalev","gloss":"Caleb"},{"id":"H0715","lemma":"אַרְדּוֹן","transliteration":"ardon","gloss":"Ardon"},{"id":"H1495","lemma":"גָּזֵז","transliteration":"gazez","gloss":"Gazez"},{"id":"H1529","lemma":"גֵּישָׁן","transliteration":"geshan","gloss":"Geshan"},{"id":"H2354","lemma":"חוּר","transliteration":"chur","gloss":"Hur"},{"id":"H2771","lemma":"חָרָן","transliteration":"charan","gloss":"Haran"},{"id":"H3147","lemma":"יוֹתָם","transliteration":"yotam","gloss":"Jotham"}],"senses":[{"id":"H8174H","gloss":"Shaaph","relation":"H8174H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}